					<p><b>The right to delete Personal Data.</b> You also have the right to request the deletion of Your Personal Data that have been collected in the past 12 months.</p>

					<p><b>The right not to be discriminated against. </b> You have the right not to be discriminated against for exercising any of Your Consumer's rights, including by:</p>

					<p>1. Denying goods or services to You<br>2. Charging different prices or rates for goods or services, including the use of discounts or other benefits or imposing penalties<br>3. Providing a different level or quality of goods or services to You<br>4. Suggesting that You will receive a different price or rate for goods or services or a different level or quality of goods or services.</p>

