					<p>The opt out will place a cookie on Your computer that is unique to the browser You use to opt out. If you change browsers or delete the cookies saved by your browser, you will need to opt out again.</p>

					<p><b>Mobile Devices:</b> Your mobile device may give you the ability to opt out of the use of information about the apps you use in order to serve you ads that are targeted to your interests:</p>

					<p>1. "Opt out of Interest-Based Ads" or "Opt out of Ads Personalization" on Android devices<br><br>2 ."Limit Ad Tracking" on iOS devices</p>
					<p>You can also stop the collection of location information from Your mobile device by changing the preferences on your mobile device.</p>

					<h4 class="mt-5 mb-3">"Do Not Track" Policy as Required by California<br>Online Privacy Protection Act (CalOPPA)</h4>

